.SH "struct pdg::SpriteLayerEvent"
.PP 
\fBSpriteLayerEvent\fP\&. 

something happened to this layer

.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
Documentation-only JavaScript shape, not a runtime constructor\&.
.RE
.PP
 
.PP
\fBFields\fP
.RS 4
Field  Type  Required/default  Meaning  actingLayer  \fR\fBSpriteLayer\fP\fP or \fRnull\fP  Required  action  \fRnumber\fP  Required  emitter  \fR\fBEventEmitter\fP\fP  Required  eventType  \fRnumber\fP  Required  millisec  \fRnumber\fP  Required  
.RE
.PP
This event can be generated with \fBpdg\&.action_LayerFadeInComplete\fP or \fBpdg\&.action_LayerFadeOutComplete\fP when the layer finishes a fade\&.

.PP
These events are also generated regularly by a \fBSpriteLayer\fP to give the application a chance to take action at various stages of sprite animation and rendering\&. 
.PP
.nf
{ 
    emitter: {},            // the emitter that generated this event
    eventType: 18,          // the event type (eventType_SpriteLayer)
    action: 0,              // one of: action_AnimationStart/Complete, etc\&.\&.\&.
    actingLayer: {},        // the SpriteLayer that is taking action
    millisec: 1025448321,   // the millisecond time when this entire animation step started (when action_AnimationStart fired) 
}  

.fi
.PP

.PP
A single step of animation will generate these events:

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBpdg\&.action_AnimationStart\fP with actingLayer set to the first layer (Z-order = 0)
.IP "\(bu" 2
for each layer, with actingLayer set to that layer, in Z-order (0\&.\&.\&.n):
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fBpdg\&.action_PreAnimateLayer\fP just before animation starts
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fBpdg\&.action_PostAnimateLayer\fP after all animation is complete
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBpdg\&.action_AnimationComplete\fP with actingLayer set to the last layer
.PP

.PP
In a similar fashion, a rendering a single frame will generate these events:

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBpdg\&.action_ErasePort\fP with actingLayer set to the first layer (Z-order = 0)
.IP "\(bu" 2
for each layer, with actingLayer set to that layer, in Z-order (0\&.\&.\&.n):
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fBpdg\&.action_PreDrawLayer\fP just before layer rendering starts
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fBpdg\&.action_PostDrawLayer\fP after all sprites in the layer have been drawn
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBpdg\&.action_DrawPortComplete\fP with actingLayer set to the last layer
.PP

.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
\fBpdg\&.eventType_SpriteLayer\fP 
.RE
.PP

.PP
\fBClass Members:\fP
.RS 4
\fBSpriteLayer\fP \fIactingLayer\fP actingLayer Type: \fR\fBSpriteLayer\fP\fP or \fRnull\fP\&. Required\&. 
.br
.PP
number \fIaction\fP action Type: \fRnumber\fP\&. Required\&. 
.br
.PP
\fBEventEmitter\fP \fIemitter\fP emitter Type: \fR\fBEventEmitter\fP\fP\&. Required\&. 
.br
.PP
number \fIeventType\fP eventType Type: \fRnumber\fP\&. Required\&. 
.br
.PP
number \fImillisec\fP millisec Type: \fRnumber\fP\&. Required\&. 
.br
.PP
.RE
